                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hart to Mr.
                            Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-02-01"><hi rendition="#italic">February 1,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hart acknowledges the receipt of the Department’s telegram of January 22,
                    and requests instructions as to amount of indemnity to be demanded of the
                    Colombian Government.* * *)</p>
            </div>
